# sshd, for reaching the board over its own access point while debugging.
#
# Short on purpose. The board is on a network it serves, with a passphrase on it,
# and nothing here is reachable from anywhere else — so root with a password is
# the whole of it, and UseDNS is off because there is no resolver on this network
# and every login would otherwise wait for a reverse lookup to time out.
Port 22
HostKey /etc/ssh/ssh_host_ed25519_key
PermitRootLogin yes
PasswordAuthentication yes
PermitEmptyPasswords no
UsePAM no
UseDNS no
PrintMotd no
Subsystem sftp internal-sftp
